WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.170
One single trade kills your account? Then it was too big.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:12.170
The rule: risk only half a percent to one percent of your account per trade.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:17.940
Step one: with a five thousand dollar account, one percent is fifty dollars.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:24.050
Step two: stop five dollars away. Then zero point one lot fits.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:29.820
Step three: even ten losses in a row only cost you about ten percent.

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:36.660
Common mistake: picking the lot size first. Stop comes first, then size.

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:40.260
No time to analyze the market yourself?

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:46.080
I show how I plan my risk live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
